"""Sparse eight-task continuation worker, candidate requiring independent review.

Derived from reviewed V164 worker; numerical evaluator and lifecycle unchanged.

Transport/child cleanup code is reused; plan admission and completion semantics
are changed and require separate execution review. No provisioning or deletion authority.

An independently armed provider-deletion guard is still required by dispatch.
This worker's deadline kills computations only; it cannot stop cloud billing.
"""
